WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.276
The lasting message: you can turn a standard
two-stage pose estimator into one that tells you how wrong it might be,

00:00:07.356 --> 00:00:11.207
with a real statistical guarantee, and pay little
in accuracy.

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:14.758
Conformal prediction supplies coverage on the keypoints,

00:00:14.838 --> 00:00:17.548
geometry propagates it to the pose as PURSE,

00:00:17.628 --> 00:00:22.430
and semidefinite relaxation converts the set into
concrete worst-case bounds.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:25.411
Because it wraps any heatmap keypoint detector,

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:30.420
the approach points toward provably correct
perception wherever safety matters.
